<EnglishInfoPage title="Cookie Policy | QCT Commerce" description="Cookie policy explaining essential functionality, consent preferences and optional analytics on qctcommerce.com." eyebrow="LEGAL" heading="Cookie policy" lead="Essential site functions and optional analytics are handled separately. Optional analytics follows the user's consent choice." sections={[{title:'Essential functions',text:'Technical storage may be used where required for core site operation and preference handling.'},{title:'Optional analytics',text:'GA4, Google Tag Manager, Microsoft Clarity and Cansu measurement tools load only after analytics consent. Rejecting or withdrawing consent stops measurement. Clarity session recording also requires recording consent. Clarity masks text. You can change your preference using the Cookie preferences button.'},{title:'Preference controls',text:'Where available, the site’s cookie controls can be used to manage optional analytics preferences.'},{title:'Questions',text:'Questions about cookies or privacy can be sent to info@qctcommerce.com.'}]}/>
